@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@phoneA = 13800000001
@passwordA = Test123456
@phoneB = 13800000002
@passwordB = Test123456
@tokenA = paste-user-a-token-here
@tokenB = paste-user-b-token-here
@idempotencyTokenA = paste-user-a-idempotency-token-here
@idempotencyTokenB = paste-user-b-idempotency-token-here
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@orderIdA = 1
@orderIdB = 2
@requestIdA = REQ_PASTE_HERE


### 1. 注册用户 B，用于越权验证；如果已注册会返回重复手机号
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "permission_user_b",
  "phone": "{{phoneB}}",
  "password": "{{passwordB}}"
}


### 2. 用户 A 登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginName": "{{phoneA}}",
  "password": "{{passwordA}}"
}


### 3. 用户 B 登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginName": "{{phoneB}}",
  "password": "{{passwordB}}"
}


### 4. 用户 A 获取下单幂等 token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### 5. [已废弃] 用户 A 同步下单，请求体不传 userId；仅保留阶段 1 权限兼容验证
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyTokenA}}"
}


### 6. 用户 A 查询自己的订单成功
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderIdA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### 7. 用户 B 查询用户 A 的订单失败
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderIdA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}


### 8. 用户 B 取消用户 A 的订单失败
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderIdA}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}


### 9. 旧直接支付接口已废弃，用户 B 也不能通过它操作用户 A 的订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderIdA}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}


### 10. 用户 A 查询自己的订单列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### 11. 旧路径兼容但忽略 path userId，只返回当前 token 用户的订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/999/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### 12. 用户 A 获取异步下单幂等 token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### 13. 用户 A 异步下单，请求体不传 userId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyTokenA}}"
}


### 14. 用户 A 查询自己的异步下单请求成功
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order-requests/{{requestIdA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


### 15. 用户 B 查询用户 A 的异步下单请求失败
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order-requests/{{requestIdA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}
